{"code":"PK26","wikidata":"Q123537786","wikipedia":{"en":"Nopparat MRT station","th":"สถานีนพรัตน์"},"summary":{"en":"Nopparat station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Ram Inthra Road, near Nopparat Rajathanee Hospital in Khan Na Yao district, Bangkok. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีนพรัตน์ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนรามอินทราในพื้นที่เขตคันนายาว กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Nopparat_Station_20231203-4.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"